31: ## 2. Rust Cryptographic Primitives & Dependency Mapping
32: 
33: The crate workspace already includes the required cryptographic dependencies in `crates/flightreader-core/Cargo.toml`:
34: 
35: ```toml
36: [dependencies]
37: aes = "0.8"
38: cbc = { version = "0.1", features = ["block-padding"] }
