491: ## 5. Demuxer & Pipeline Integration
492: 
493: In a streaming consumer decoding DJI v13/v14 `.txt` logs:
494: 
495: ```
496: [RawRecordEnvelope] 
497:       │
498:       ▼
499: Check is_plaintext_bypass() || get_feature_point(version, type) == 8
500:   ├── YES ──► Immediate Plaintext (KeyStorage 56, FlightRecordRecover 50)
501:   │
502:   └── NO  ──► 1. xor::descramble_slice(&payload[1..], &mut ct_buf, key)
503:               2. aes_engine.decrypt_into(feature_point, ciphertext, &mut pt_buf)
504:               3. TelemetryDecoder::parse(plaintext)
505: ```
506: 
507: ### Clean Memory & Zero Allocations
508: All buffers (`ct_buf`, `pt_buf`, `out_buf`) can reside on the stack or in pre-allocated scratch arenas, achieving **0 heap allocations per telemetry frame** throughout the decryption pipeline.
